version: "0.0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
abstract: >
  Semantic framework for preparing scientific simulation scenarios, validating
  typed configurations and qualifying numerical outputs with explicit provenance.
  The current implementation runs a pinned TLS backend and exports CSV, JSON and RDF.
  Outputs are synthetic and have not been validated against field measurements.

keywords:
  - semantic web
  - scientific software
  - large language models
  - simulation configuration
  - provenance
  - PROV-O
  - FAIR
  - reproducibility
